{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 40, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and make thy way to the airport, where thou shalt board a plane bound for the land of the rising sun, Japan.\n\nUpon arrival in Tokyo, the capital city, thou shalt visit the Meiji Shrine, a peaceful and spiritual oasis amidst the hustle and bustle of the metropolis. Here, thou shalt pay homage to the deities enshrined and partake in the traditional cleansing ritual at the purification fountain.\n \\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nNext, thou shalt venture to the Asakusa district, where thou shalt marvel at the Senso-ji Temple, Tokyo's oldest temple, and explore the Nakamise shopping street, lined with stalls selling souvenirs and traditional snacks.\n\nAt nightfall, thou shalt visit the Shibuya Crossing, the busiest intersection in the world, and witness the throngs of people and neon lights that make it a true spectacle.\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nOn the morrow, thou shalt take a train to the ancient city of Kyoto, the former imperial capital of Japan. Here, thou shalt visit the Kinkaku-ji Temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion, and admire its reflection on the mirror-like surface of the surrounding pond.\n\nThou shalt then proceed to the Fushimi Inari Shrine, renowned for its thousands of vermilion torii gates that form a tunnel leading up the sacred mountain.\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nThe following day, thou shalt journey to Hiroshima, the city that was devastated by an atomic bomb during World War II. Here, thou shalt visit the Peace Memorial Park and the Atomic Bomb Dome, a poignant reminder of the horrors of war and the power of peace.\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nOn the final day of thy sojourn, thou shalt return to Tokyo and visit the Tsukiji Fish Market, the largest fish market in the world, where thou shalt feast on the freshest sushi and sashimi.\n\nAt last, thou shalt bid farewell to Japan and board a plane back to thy homeland, with memories of the land of the rising sun forever etched in thy heart and mind.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013940464705228806}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.4145479202270508}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.043870359659194946}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.6569954823353328e-05}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.02116977609694004}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0013780631124973297}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "arise", "logprob": -0.08117979019880295}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -5.722029527532868e-06}, {"token": "make", "logprob": -0.031011493876576424}, {"token": "thy", "logprob": -0.06536614149808884}, {"token": "way", "logprob": -4.660974445869215e-05}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -9.7508447652217e-05}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -4.0649541915627196e-05}, {"token": "airport", "logprob": -0.13174879550933838}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.06307200342416763}, {"token": "where", "logprob": -0.00956748053431511}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -1.071375846862793}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.023213999345898628}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "board", "logprob": -0.011271962895989418}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -2.1815061700181104e-05}, {"token": "plane", "logprob": -0.6699663400650024}, {"token": "bound", "logprob": -0.07182200998067856}, {"token": "for", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.00411330908536911}, {"token": "land", "logprob": -0.25284671783447266}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.0001494772732257843}, {"token": "rising", "logprob": -0.00043358939001336694}, {"token": "sun", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.01843520812690258}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.0004996005445718765}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.1977